        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6791 Arched Hamilton, formerly Stanford, Mortise Entry Set with 5152 Drop Tail Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBaldwin's Hamilton Entry Set is made out of solid brass with a limited lifetime warranty on the mechanics, materials, and on the PVD Polished Brass Finish. The arched shape of this 6791 Entrance Set is enhanced by the 5152 Drop Tail Lever for a classic look that will look great in any traditional home. It will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". Available as a single cylinder, double cylinder, or a dummy set function.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6791 Hamilton Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation, and finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Estate Collection Hamilton Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Lifetime PVD Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5152 Lever</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10.875\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .687\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.774\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6951.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b> Hamilton Entry Set Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a lever operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a lever operates entrance set latch; while from the interior, it is operated by a lever. The deadbolt is operated by a key from both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-3-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354505\" width=\"350\" height=\"125\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Hamilton Mortise Entry Set, Baldwin 6791",
                "description": "Baldwin Hamilton 6791 Entry Set - Baldwin's Stanford Entry Set is made out of solid brass with a limited lifetime warranty on the mechanics, materials, and on the PVD Polished Brass Finish. The arched shape of this 6791 Entrance Set is enhanced by the 5152 Drop Tail Lever for a classic look that will look great in any traditional home. It will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Available as a single cylinder, double cylinder, or a dummy set function.",
                "keywords": "BAL-6791, baldwin 6791 Hamilton entry sets, baldwin Stanford door entrance sets, single cylinder entrance sets, emergency egress entrance sets,  Bladwin ornate Estate Collection entrance sets, traditional entrance sets, classic entrance sets, ornate entrance sets, stanford entrance sets, ADA compliant Levers, BAL-6951, baldwin 6951, hamilton entry set,"
